  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 4 x plus b\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">For the linear function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math> is a constant and&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 7 right parenthesis equals 28\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
